    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ka Gees Ah Boqorkii Turos",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, amiirka Turos waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Qalbigaagu kor buu isu qaaday, oo waxaad tidhi, Anigu Ilaah baan ahay, oo badaha dhexdooda ayaan kursigii Ilaah ku dul fadhiyaa, laakiinse waxaad tahay binu-aadmi oo Ilaah ma tihid in kastoo aad qalbigaagii qalbigii Ilaah oo kale ka dhigtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg, adigu xataa Daanyeel waad ka sii xigmad badan tahay, oo wax qarsoodi ah oo lagaa qarin karaana innaba ma jiraan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xigmaddaada iyo waxgarashadaada ayaad maalka ku heshay, oo khasnadahaagana waxaad ku buuxsatay dahab iyo lacag. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xigmaddaada badan iyo baayacmushtarkaaga ayaad maalkaaga ku sii korodhsatay, oo qalbigaaguna maalkaaga aawadiis ayuu kor isula qaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Qalbigaagii sidii qalbigii Ilaah oo kale ayaad ka dhigtay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sidaas daraaddeed bal ogow waxaan kugu soo kicin doonaa shisheeyayaal oo ah kuwa cabsida leh ee quruumaha, oo iyaguna waxay seeftooda ula soo bixi doonaan inay quruxda xigmaddaada ku kharribaan, oo dhalaalkaagana way nijaasayn doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamayskay kugu ridi doonaan, oo waxaad u dhiman doontaa sida dhimashadii kuwii badaha dhexdooda lagu laayay oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kan ku dilaya weli ma hortiisaad ka odhan doontaa, Anigu Ilaah baan ahay, in kastoo aad binu-aadmi tahay, Ilaahse ma tihid, adoo gacanta kan ku dilaya ku jira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad shisheeyayaal gacantooda ugu dhiman doontaa sida dhimashadii buuryaqabka, waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Aniga ayaa saas ku hadlay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, boqorka Turos baroor u qaad, oo waxaad isaga ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Adigu waxaad ahayd dhammaystirkii kaamilnimada, oo waxaa kaa buuxday xigmad, quruxdaaduna kaamil bay ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad joogi jirtay Ceeden oo ahayd beertii Ilaah, oo waxaad huwatay dhagax kasta oo qaali ah, kuwaasoo ahaa sardiyos, iyo tobasiyos, iyo dheemman, iyo berullos, iyo onika, iyo yasbid, iyo safayr, iyo sumurud, iyo mid birqaya, oo dafafkaaga iyo biibiilayaashaada shuqulkoodu wuu kula jiray. Maalintii lagu abuuray waa laguu diyaariyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad ahayd keruubkii subkanaa ee wax dabooli jiray, oo aniga ayaa saas kaa dhigay si aad buurta quduuska ah ee Ilaah u joogtid. Oo waxaad hor iyo dib ugu dhex socon jirtay dhagaxyo dab ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maalintii lagu abuuray iyo ilaa markii xaqdarro lagaa helay jidadkaagaad kaamil ku ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baayacmushtarigaaga badan aawadiis waxaa dhexdaada laga buuxiyey dulmi, waanad dembaabtay, oo sidaas daraaddeed ayaan adiga sida wax nijaas ah oo kale buurta Ilaah kaaga xooray. Keruubkii wax dabooli jirayow, waan ku halligay oo dhagxanta dabka ah dhexdooda waan kaa baabbi'iyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qalbigaagu quruxdaaduu kor isula qaaday, oo xigmaddaadiina waxaad la kharribtay dhalaalkaaga. Dhulkaan kugu xooray oo boqorro hortood ayaan ku dhigay si ay kuu arkaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meelahaagii quduuska ahaa waxaad ku nijaasaysay xumaatooyinkaagii badnaa, iyo xaqdarradii baayacmushtarkaaga, oo sidaas daraaddeed dhexdaadaan dab ka soo bixiyey, oo isna wuu ku baabbi'iyey, oo dhulka korkiisa ayaan dambas kaaga dhigay iyadoo ay kuwa kuu jeeda oo dhammu indhaha kugu hayaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dadyowga dhexdooda kuwa kugu yaqaan oo dhammu adigay kula yaabi doonaan, cabsi baad noqotay, oo weligaana mar dambe ma aad jiri doontid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
